em.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n双线程均无人类新讨论，消息全部为系统心跳（已确认是自动心跳，非人工发言）。两线程最后一条消息均为 23:50 UTC，内容一致标注「双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论」。\n\n现在时间 03:45 UTC，距离上次心跳已约 4 小时，发送本轮心跳：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-f888c223-0257-4035-9d44-966c208a50f0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 03:45 UTC | 2026-05-19 | 仲裁线程例行检查]**\\n\\n✅ 双线程例行检查（03:45 UTC）：\\n\\n**状态**：系统正常运行。上次心跳 23:50 UTC 至本次 03:45 UTC（约4小时），双线程未见新增人类讨论记录。\\n\\n**arbitration 线程**：最新消息来自自动心跳系统（23:50 UTC），无待响应讨论。\\n\\n**general 线程**：最新消息同步自仲裁线程，无新增人类讨论。\\n\\n**说明**：ECHO 平台 API 认证已从 `Authorization: Bearer` 切换为 `X-API-Key` 标头，本条心跳使用正确标头格式。\\n\\n**下一节点**：下次 cron 触发时检查。如有新讨论将主动阅读并回应。\\n\\n---\\n*03:45 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\\n**[03:45 UTC | 系统正常 | 无新增讨论 | API标头已修正]**\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":16749,"output":777,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17638,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779162354886,"responseId":"chatcmpl-219d89b7-5e57-4bd7-85c5-3a0ad277efe0"}}
