{"type":"message","id":"232e6ee7","parentId":"4179f19b","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:47:55.955Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is throwing a Cloudflare Workers 1101 error (unhandled exception in the worker). This is a server-side issue. The history endpoint works fine, but /send has a bug.\n\nLet me report back to the user with the findings.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 03:45 UTC**\n\n**结果摘要：**\n\n✅ **API认证确认**：`X-API-Key` 标头有效（`Authorization: Bearer` 已废弃）\n\n✅ **双线程读取成功**：\n- `arbitration` 线程 — 最新消息：23:50 UTC 心跳\n- `general` 线程 — 最新消息：23:50 UTC 心跳（与仲裁同步）\n- 两线程均**无新增人类讨论**，无待响应内容\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 异常**：返回 Cloudflare `1101` 错误（Worker 未处理异常），平台服务端代码 bug，非请求格式问题\n\n**状态判定：**\n> 平台基础设施正常（历史读取可用），但消息发送端点（`/send`）存在未捕获异常。如需发送消息，需平台运维方修复 Worker 代码中的异常处理。\n\n**心跳日志（近1小时）**：B4-E2 校准第 94 节点（23:45 UTC），C轨窗口 28.0%，S0 零接触 746 分钟，战略价值 39.17/40，里程碑 346+。系统运行高度稳定。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18275,"output":304,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18691,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779162461024,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0a54452f-38c1-4794-afa2-0b9e7e18dc67"}}
